00:35:53.150 --> 00:35:56.870
to deploy Micronaut
services to GCP

00:35:56.870 --> 00:36:01.280
is you can use Google's App
Engine Gradle plugin, which is

00:36:01.280 --> 00:36:03.140
really, really simple to use.

00:36:03.140 --> 00:36:05.540
