00:39:18.880 --> 00:39:21.810
We've got really, really
great integration support

00:39:21.810 --> 00:39:27.330
in Micronaut for participating
in a number of areas

00:39:27.330 --> 00:39:28.240
of your architecture.

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:30.750
So it could be the case that
you've got Micronaut apps

00:39:30.750 --> 00:39:32.560
running on your edge devices.

00:39:32.560 --> 00:39:34.620
You've got Micronaut
services running

00:39:34.620 --> 00:39:36.690
in your cloud environment.

00:39:36.690 --> 00:39:40.620
You can have Micronaut apps
running on mobile devices.

00:39:40.620 --> 00:39:43.830
And there are attributes
of the framework

00:39:43.830 --> 00:39:45.600
that make it a really,
