00:42:55.470 --> 00:42:58.430
This is the HTTP client that's
being used in the frontend

00:42:58.430 --> 00:43:00.320
to communicate with the backend.

00:43:00.320 --> 00:43:03.280
And notice on line 12 there
where the client annotation

00:43:03.280 --> 00:43:05.310
is, is the word companies.

00:43:05.310 --> 00:43:07.520
What's happened is all
four of the company

00:43:07.520 --> 00:43:10.220
services have started up
and registered themselves

00:43:10.220 --> 00:43:12.710
with Consul, our service
discovery engine that's

00:43:12.710 --> 00:43:14.660
running on one of the devices.

00:43:14.660 --> 00:43:17.120
So on the frontend, when
I want to communicate

00:43:17.120 --> 00:43:20.150
with those devices, I've
annotated this interface

00:43:20.150 --> 00:43:21.440
with @clientcompanies.

00:43:21.440 --> 00:43:23.840
And what will happen when
this client is initialized

00:43:23.840 --> 00:43:27.290
is Micronaut will reach out to
the service discovery engine

00:43:27.290 --> 00:43:29.960
and find, where are all
the company services.

00:43:29.960 --> 00:43:33.680
So it discovers these four
Raspberry Pis dynamically,

00:43:33.680 --> 00:43:36.230
and it's round
robining through them--

00:43:36.230 --> 00:43:38.390
doing client side load
bouncing to round robin

00:43:38.390 --> 00:43:40.110
through all those devices.

00:43:40.110 --> 00:43:41.780
And then when one
of them disappears,

00:43:41.780 --> 00:43:45.140
the round robining just skips
over, 1, 2, 4, 1, 2, 4, 1, 2,

00:43:45.140 --> 00:43:48.370
4, if number three
is out of the mix.

00:43:48.370 --> 00:43:51.230
And I don't have to write any
of that code in the application

00:43:51.230 --> 00:43:52.440
to take advantage of that.

00:43:52.440 --> 00:43:56.780
So here in my home controller,
this is in the frontend.

00:43:56.780 --> 00:43:58.850
That's the call to the backend.

00:43:58.850 --> 00:44:01.520
There's no code here
related to round robining.

00:44:01.520 --> 00:44:03.698
There's no code here
related to retry logic.

00:44:03.698 --> 00:44:05.240
I'm just saying, go
get the companies

00:44:05.240 --> 00:44:06.860
