00:44:06.860 --> 00:44:09.530
And all of the
complexity and stuff

00:44:09.530 --> 00:44:11.180
that it takes to
make that happen

00:44:11.180 --> 00:44:13.800
is all handled inside
of this HTTP client.

00:44:13.800 --> 00:44:15.230
So the client side
load balancing

00:44:15.230 --> 00:44:16.790
is built into this client.

00:44:16.790 --> 00:44:19.850
The retry logic is
built into the client.

00:44:19.850 --> 00:44:23.360
And now my application code
